## Burn Mechanisms (3 layers)

1. **Forward Burn Policy** — 9% of every monthly unlock (e.g. 20,000,000 DCTR unlock → 1,800,000 DCTR burned / 18,200,000 DCTR released)
2. **Burn-to-Mint NFT Trophies** — minting/redeeming any NFT Trophy requires burning DCTR per trophy tier
3. **Unclaimed Trophy Burn** — any unclaimed seasonal reward pool balance is burned at season close

Plus: **Founder's Exceptional Decree** — a rare, publicly-announced, occasion-triggered discretionary burn above the standard 9%, bound by guardrails (see main Whitepaper Section 3.1.3).

